{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.ChiLambdaW0SignWeighting","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_lambda_w0_sign_weighting","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_lambda_w0_sign_weighting","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L142-L159","doc":"**Long-element sign-weighting, verified at `k ∈ {5, 6}`.** At each\nwitnessed level the `S_3` character-weighted sum at `w₀` collapses to\n`c_k^{(3)} − c_k^{(1,1,1)}` — the standard `(2,1)` block drops out because\n`χ_{(2,1)}(w₀) = 0` (`S_w0_simp`) — and is strictly negative\n(`S_w0_at_k{5,6}_neg`), matching the empirical sign of the `c_k` chain\n(both `-395.41` and `-45485` per `per-wedderburn-block-ck.witness.json`).\n\n(The earlier free-variable phrasing \"`sign(c_k_chain) = sign(S_w0 …)`\" was\nill-posed — `c_k_chain` was unconstrained, making the biconditional false\nfor e.g. `c_k_chain = -1` with all `c_k^{(λ)} = 0`. The genuine content is\nthe collapse together with the per-level sign, verified against the\nwitnessed coefficients.) ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting","label":"prop:chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k6_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k6_neg","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L116-L122","doc":"The long-element-weighted sum is **strictly negative** at\n$k = 6$ — matching the empirical $c_6 \\approx -45485$ in\nsign. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k5_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k5_neg","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L107-L114","doc":"The long-element-weighted sum is **strictly negative** at\n$k = 5$ — matching the empirical $c_5 \\approx -395.41$ in\nsign (the Plancherel-weighted sum is **positive**, wrong\nsign). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k6","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L99-L105","doc":"Witnessed long-element sum at $k = 6$ ($\\varepsilon^{12}$):\n$S_6^{(w_0)} = 1/4 - 955/2 = -1909/4 = -477.25$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_at_k5","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L91-L97","doc":"Witnessed long-element sum at $k = 5$ ($\\varepsilon^{10}$):\n$S_5^{(w_0)} = 1/4 - 533/2 = -1065/4 = -266.25$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_simp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0_simp","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L85-L89","doc":"The $S_3$ long-element character-weighted sum equals\n$c_k^{(3)} - c_k^{(1,1,1)}$ (since $\\chi_{(2,1)}(w_0) = 0$). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.S_w0","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L77-L80","doc":"Long-element character-weighted sum at level $k$ for $H_3$:\n$S_k^{(w_0)} = c_k^{(3)} - c_k^{(1,1,1)}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V111","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L74-L75","doc":"$c_6^{(1,1,1)} = 955/2 = 477.5$ (witnessed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V21","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L71-L72","doc":"$c_6^{(2,1)} = 45/2 = 22.5$ (witnessed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c6_V3","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L68-L69","doc":"$c_6^{(3)} = 1/4 = 0.25$ (witnessed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V111","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L65-L66","doc":"$c_5^{(1,1,1)} = 533/2 = 266.5$ (witnessed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V21","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L62-L63","doc":"$c_5^{(2,1)} = 65/4 = 16.25$ (witnessed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.c5_V3","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L59-L60","doc":"$c_5^{(3)} = 1/4 = 0.25$ (witnessed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_at_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_at_w0","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L46-L47","doc":"Character value of the sign $S_3$-irrep at the long element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_at_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V21_at_w0","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L43-L44","doc":"Character value of the standard $S_3$-irrep at the long element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_at_w0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_at_w0","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/chi-lambda-w0-sign-weighting.lean#L40-L41","doc":"Character value of the trivial $S_3$-irrep at the long element. ","signatureChunk":0}]}